Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.51,TL,,0,0,0,,她是怎么第一次闯进单打年终的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:08.49,TL,,0,0,0,,温网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:10.96,TL,,0,0,0,,安德烈耶娃都先赢下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.17,TL,,0,0,0,,最后却都没赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:16.30,TL,,0,0,0,,同一个赛季 她又拿了{\fs78}3{\fs68}座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.42,TL,,0,0,0,,看懂她的第一次单打年终
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:21.08,TL,,0,0,0,,要把这些比赛放在一起看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:23.56,TL,,0,0,0,,布里斯班止步八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.21,TL,,0,0,0,,随后的阿德莱德决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:28.12,TL,,0,0,0,,她开场{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后 随后连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:30.46,TL,,0,0,0,,以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.85,TL,,0,0,0,,先落后的那个人 笑到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:43.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Andreeva's title in Adelaide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃在阿德莱德夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:49.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A ruthless demolition job on the world number 17.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对世界第{\fs78}17{\fs68}的彻底压制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:51.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Mboko was struggling physically,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而姆博科身体状况不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:55.16,TL,,0,0,520,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she has been well and truly put to the sword.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她也被对手彻底击溃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:57.99,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网 她停在第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.44,TL,,0,0,0,,随后多哈到迈阿密的四站硬地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.33,TL,,0,0,0,,最好也只到八强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.34,TL,,0,0,0,,一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:06.24,TL,,0,0,0,,并没能让后面的路变得简单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:09.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月来到林茨 决赛首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:11.76,TL,,0,0,0,,她用{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.38,TL,,0,0,0,,把比赛翻了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.70,TL,,0,0,0,,第二座奖杯 仍然是从落后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:20.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二次冠军点机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:28.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The top seed, the world number 10,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子 世界第{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:35.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}has just been able to claim her fifth WTA title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了第五座{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:41.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And how hard that Andreeva has had to work,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃付出了多少努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:43.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}not just today, but throughout the week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不仅今天 更是整个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:48.96,TL,,0,0,0,,斯图加特打进四强后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.86,TL,,0,0,0,,她来到马德里决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.33,TL,,0,0,0,,科斯秋克两盘取胜 这一回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:56.20,TL,,0,0,0,,她没能再复制那场逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:17.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A spectacular display of dialed-in determination{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N极其专注而坚定的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:20.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}yields a new queen of the clay in Madrid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成就了马德里新红土女王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:23.87,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马止步八强 巴黎却打到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:26.43,TL,,0,0,0,,她先在半决赛击败科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.52,TL,,0,0,0,,再赢下赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:30.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁 第一座大满贯奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.67,TL,,0,0,0,,终于属于她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:51.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The teenager becomes a champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位少女成为了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.78,TL,,0,0,0,,本季红土{\fs78}22{\fs68}胜{\fs78}3{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.83,TL,,0,0,0,,草地却是{\fs78}1{\fs68}胜{\fs78}2{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.22,TL,,0,0,0,,温网第二轮 她先赢{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.53,TL,,0,0,0,,后两盘却连着丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:15.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Krejcikova has earned herself another match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N克雷吉茨科娃又拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's that net cord again{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是这次擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that does for Andreeva.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让安德烈耶娃败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:40.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The former champion inspired and helped{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位前冠军再次受到鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:44.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by Centre Court once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N并得到中央球场的助力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:47.73,TL,,0,0,0,,多伦多和辛辛那提 都没走到八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:50.59,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 她先赢{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 第二盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:53.21,TL,,0,0,0,,还有两次直接结束比赛的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.12,TL,,0,0,0,,可最后 高芙完成了逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:59.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Second match point now for Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在是高芙的第二个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.02,TL,,0,0,0,,新加坡止步八强后 {\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:31.31,TL,,0,0,0,,官方确认她首次获得单打年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:34.67,TL,,0,0,0,,北京那场决赛 还在两天以后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:37.17,TL,,0,0,0,,到了北京 她再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:40.47,TL,,0,0,0,,却{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}负于郑钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:43.57,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她本赛季第五次打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:54.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the ultimate exclamation point{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用最有力的惊叹号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to conquer the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N征服中国网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:01.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}12{\fs68}日 她第一次排到世界第{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:04.52,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉那一站 则因调整赛程退出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:08.65,TL,,0,0,0,,本季至今 {\fs78}50{\fs68}胜{\fs78}16{\fs68}负 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.88,TL,,0,0,0,,本季的{\fs78}3{\fs68}座冠军和马德里亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.72,TL,,0,0,0,,构成了她通往年终的重要积累
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.11,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次单打年终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:19.77,TL,,0,0,0,,她能把这一年的高光再延续下去吗？
